Package: earthquakes
Type: Package
Title: Clean, Visualize and Map the NOAA Significant Earthquakes Database
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jefferson", "Ramirez", email = "jramirezgen@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to clean the NOAA (National Oceanic and Atmospheric
    Administration) Significant Earthquake Database, draw timelines of
    earthquakes with 'ggplot2' (time line geom and labels) and map the
    epicentres on an interactive 'leaflet' map with annotations. The package
    includes a copy of the database.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    grid,
    leaflet,
    lubridate,
    magrittr,
    scales,
    stringr
Suggests:
    knitr,
    readr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
